# Project Overview

This is a **Payload CMS E-commerce Template** - a full-stack e-commerce solution built with Next.js 13, Payload CMS, and Stripe integration.

## Architecture Overview

- **Frontend**: Next.js 13 with App Router (React 18)
- **Backend**: Payload CMS with Express server
- **Database**: MongoDB (via `@payloadcms/db-mongodb`)
- **Payments**: Stripe integration
- **Styling**: CSS with layout builder components
- **Authentication**: Built-in user auth with role-based access control

## Core Technologies

- Next.js 13.5.6 with App Router
- Payload CMS v2.0.7
- React 18.2.0
- TypeScript 4.8.4
- Stripe integration
- MongoDB database
- Express server

## Project Structure

```
├── src/
│   ├── app/                 # Next.js 13 App Router
│   │   ├── (pages)/        # Route groups
│   │   ├── _api/           # API utilities
│   │   ├── _blocks/        # Layout builder blocks
│   │   ├── _components/    # Reusable React components
│   │   ├── _css/           # CSS styles
│   │   ├── _graphql/       # GraphQL queries
│   │   ├── _heros/         # Hero section components
│   │   ├── _providers/     # Context providers
│   │   └── _utilities/     # Frontend utilities
│   ├── payload/            # Payload CMS configuration
│   │   ├── collections/    # CMS collections (Products, Users, Orders, etc.)
│   │   ├── globals/        # Global settings (Header, Footer)
│   │   ├── blocks/         # Content blocks for layout builder
│   │   ├── components/     # Admin panel components
│   │   ├── access/         # Access control logic
│   │   ├── hooks/          # Payload hooks
│   │   ├── endpoints/      # Custom API endpoints
│   │   └── stripe/         # Stripe integration
│   ├── server.ts           # Express server setup
│   └── server.default.ts   # Default server configuration
├── public/                 # Static assets
├── media/                  # Uploaded media files
└── [config files]         # Various configuration files
```

## Key Features

- **Products**: Full product catalog with Stripe integration
- **Users**: Authentication with admin/customer roles
- **Orders**: Complete order management system
- **Shopping Cart**: Persistent cart functionality
- **Checkout**: Stripe-powered payment processing
- **Paywall**: Gated content for purchased products
- **Layout Builder**: Dynamic page building
- **SEO**: Built-in SEO optimization
- **Media**: File upload and management


